    "description": "Remover bg - Photo Editor is a beautiful photo editing application that creates transparent background for images and saves as PNG. Automatically change the background for the image with a beautiful image for you to choose from, or you can combine the font for the background image at your discretion.\r\n\r\nMain function\r\n\r\nSplit background, remove photo background\r\nCut the image background with today's most advanced AI technology\r\nRemove the background from the image\r\n\r\nChange background\r\nAutomatically remove photo background\r\nChange the background with the latest collection today\r\n1000+ beautiful wallpapers that fit each image size according to each theme you want\r\n\r\nChange the color of the sky\r\nChange the sky according to the mood: sunny morning, rainy afternoon, foggy noon\r\nThe sky change feature is very suitable for those of you who like to travel, want to take pictures of the sky but don't like it, you can use the sky in Remover bg's unique sky collection - Photo Editor .\r\n\r\nChange hair color & change hairstyle\r\nRemover bg - Photo Editor applies AI to change your hair color perfectly. You can use the hair color changer feature to see which hair color you match before going to the hair salon to get your hair done.\r\n\r\nChange your hairstyle with a collection of men's hairstyles, women's hairstyles as well as different long and short hair styles that will be great options to see which will suit your face.\r\n\r\nEdit photo\r\nAdjust brightness, dark balance\r\nCreate your own unique photo color correction formula\r\nWriting text on photos with many different fonts and colors, along with all the beautiful and meaningful sayings, will be a great suggestion for you to make your photos more meaningful, for unique statuses.\r\nUnique photo color filters\r\nTurn photos into sketches in just one touch.\r\n\r\nRemover bg - Photo Editor to edit photos to create a transparent background and change the background right 